<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container policy-page">
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>
  <p>Kono proshno, order, ba return niye kotha bolte chaile niche jekono ekta upaye jogajog koro:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:<%= shopPhone %>"><%= shopPhone %></a></li>
    <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> site-er dan diker niche WhatsApp button-e click koro — product-er link soho message jabe.</li>
    <li><strong>Order track:</strong> <a href="/track-order">Track Order</a> page-e Order ID ar phone number dao.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="field-hint">Order niye likhle Order ID-ta sathe dio — tahole amra taratari khuje ber korte parbo.</p>

  <% if (success) { %><p class="success-msg"><%= success %></p><% } %>
  <% if (error) { %><p class="error-msg"><%= error %></p><% } %>

  <h3>Message Pathao</h3>
  <form action="/contact" method="POST" class="admin-form" style="max-width:480px;">
    <label>Your Name *</label>
    <input type="text" name="name" required>
    <label>Phone (optional)</label>
    <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="01XXXXXXXXX">
    <label>Email (optional)</label>
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
    <label>Subject</label>
    <input type="text" name="subject" placeholder="jemon: Order, Return, Product question">
    <label>Message *</label>
    <textarea name="message" rows="4" required></textarea>
    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send Message</button>
  </form>
  <h3>Delivery somoy</h3>
  <p>Dhaka-r vitore 1–2 din, Dhaka-r baire 3–5 din. Chhuti ba courier-er deri hole ektu somoy beshi lagte pare.</p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
